<li>The Acid Deposition Monitoring Network in East Asia (EANET) sebagai Scientific Advisory Committee Member dari (1993 – sekarang)</li>
<li>Implementing Committee Member Viena Convention and Montreal Protocol (Secretariat-Nairobi) dan Vice Chairman Working Group III IPCC di Jenewa.</li>
